		"description": "Connect two apps, query a shared ontology and prove revocation. Core: 25 min.",
		"longDescription": "Prerequisites: two disposable online apps, role/connection administration and Data Studio table skills. In 25 minutes, import synthetic parts, expose an ontology, install/query it from a consumer, refresh one property and verify denied access after revocation. App/account setup is separate. The core is read-only; governed write actions are a later extension. Evidence is manually reviewed.",
